# NOV-PUBLIC-03A-F1: default-deny for editable source materials in release archives.
# `git archive` (the only packaging mechanism in this repository) omits them. These files are
# NOT deleted or changed; the owner decides their publication (roadmap N-4 / N-10). Legally
# binding PDFs and all approved static assets stay in the archive. Not access control for a
# working tree copied by other means: see docs/NOV-PUBLIC-03A-F1 (web-server rule / exclusions).
public/**/*.doc export-ignore
public/**/*.docx export-ignore
public/**/*.psd export-ignore
